            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutö pöytoghintö Esekia pipö Lawi Kö pö Tororöt kïtïpï cho kitïng tïkwïn cho töpölöl cho ato kirapa kusilyö nko cho kitïng pïkantis nko cho kitïng pkurerun, kïrïpata kegh nko ngölyonto Daudi nko nyo pö Kad nyo kile ngorinto ngala pöytoghin nko nyo pö werkoyon Natan. Ompöwölo kingwïna ngölyontononi ECHOTYON kuwerï werkoykachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnam pipö Lawi karïn cho kïpöghisyegho Daudi kïtumo, kïnam tïsï kontinekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwatïta pöytoghintö Esekia keropta ropöwon nyo kïpelöy ompö ato kïpelo amöros, nyini kikitor keropta ropöwontonay kïpelöy, kutor tïkwïl tum nyo kïsölo ECHOTYON nko kontin nko karichay kipöghisyegho Daudi pöytoghinto Israel kïtumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpechï nyoryonay kïmïkul kïsölisyö akïtum tumï kurur, kïkut pipö kontin kontinekwa kughum, kwigh lenyoni tökïtenö kuwonyö ropöwontonay kikïpelöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kimuchö ropöwontonay kïkïtïng pöytoghintö Esekia nko nyorye kïmïkul kïsal ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïmwochï pöytoghintö Esekia nko yetïntine walak pipö Lawi kïsala ECHOTYON tum pö pöytoghin Daudi nyo kimïn nko nyo pö ngorin Asap, kïtum tum pö sölut ompö ngörekyö, kungïrukisyö akïsölisyö.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï pöytoghintö Esekia pich, “Arikuna ye nyu opunö amörostin nko ropöw cho kïmwogho sörö kïpka Kö pö Tororöt, ompöwölo kyotïlilökwa kegh.” Kwipï nyoryonay amörostin nko ropöw cho kïmwogho sörö, akwipï pich löwïr cho kicham kwigh lenyoni ropöwekwa cho kïpelöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlïkwï ropöw cho kïpelöy cho kikonï pich, kir 70 nko mökol 100 nko wara kechir 200. Ropöwechete löwïr kikïpelöy kï ropöwo ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilïkwï tïpö amöros cho kikïmolchï yona löwïr eghin 600 nko kechir 3,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïngörïngit tïsï nyoman tömökumïcha kïyeng ropöwechoni kipelöy. Otini kitö keköngöy tïsi walak kutïlil kegh kïpka werkökwa pipö Lawi kungarak chane tökïtenö kuwonyö pöghisyononi. Kichömöy kutïlilöy kegh pipö Lawi kïtïl tïsi walaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paraku chongïn pö ropöwechoni kikïpelöy, kimi tïkwïl ropöwo sunet cho kikitötoy le ropöwo kalya. Akimi ropöw cho kïgheghöy ompö ropöwechoni kipelöy. Kïlenyona kïwö ighisyo Kö pö Tororöt kutang wölanye kimi tagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngarak pöytoghintö Esekia nko pich löwïr ompö ngölyontononi kigh Tororöt kwighchï pikachi, ompöwölo kimir chane ngölyontononi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
